    {
      "id": "hilde-arrows-ionization-zero-in",
      "title": {
        "en": "Hilde Arrows, Ionization & Zero In"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30113_srt4",
              "name": "Quiver Reload",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30113_uni1",
              "name": "Plasma Rain",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30113_uni3",
              "name": "Big Game Ranger",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Homing Arrows:\nAttack Cards that Hilde Creates in the Draw Pile\nEach Arrow has Attunement (On Draw): Activate itself\nActivating it then does an Extra Attack + Draws 1 Card\nARROWS ARE NOT CARD POSTIVE OR NEGATIVE THEY ARE NEUTRAL\nUnusable Cards also are considered 0 Cost\nIonization:\nFor every Ionization Stack the enemy takes +8% and +4% (Hilde only)\nMax Stacks 12, so +8% x 12 = +96% which is barely 5 moral\nNot very important at all\nZero In:\nFor every stack of Zero +35% into a SINGLE Extra Attack on Highest HP Opp\nMax Stack 60, so +35% x 60 = 2100%"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30113_cre1",
              "name": "Homing Arrow",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
