            "en": "E1:\n+1 Draw to Vortext Arrow is great\nE2:\n+10% Crit Chance and Mobbing Bonus Extra Attacks are good\nE3:\n10% (Weakness Final Damage) is pretty good, but only for one turn\nE4:\n40% Multi for Hilde Extra Attacks (Everything basically) is great\nE5:\nPotential Levels: It's ok\nE6:\n+15% Crit Chance to ALL INSTINCT ALLIES After 8 Find the Gap (E4 Buff)\nMax Stack of Zero is now 100 (get 15 for free) can get 85 not (15 more then old)\n+35% x 100 = 3500% AS WELL as +45% Crit Dmg to this Zero Hit"
